      "description": "Please sync tempest 1:47.0.0-2 (universe) from Debian unstable (main)\n\nExplanation of FeatureFreeze exception:\n  * Part of the OpenStack 2026.2 (Hibiscus) alignment for stonking;\n    see LP: #2167238 ([FFe] OpenStack 2026.2 Hibiscus release).\n  * tempest 47.0.0 is the 2026.2-aligned OpenStack integration test suite;\n    stonking currently carries 1:46.2.0-4 (2026.1-aligned) while nova, neutron\n    and keystone in stonking are already at 2026.2.\n  * No Ubuntu delta: the current stonking version is a straight sync of the\n    Debian package, so no Ubuntu changes are dropped.\n  * Debian changes since 1:46.2.0-4 are limited to the new upstream release\n    and removal of two patches now included upstream.\n  * Risk is minimal: tempest is a test framework in universe, not seeded on\n    any image; it only runs against OpenStack deployments.\n\nChangelog entries since current stonking version 1:46.2.0-4:\n\ntempest (1:47.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium\n\n  * Uploading to unstable.\n\n -- Thomas Goirand <email address hidden>  Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:58:01 +0200\n\ntempest (1:47.0.0-1) experimental; urgency=medium\n\n  * New upstream release.\n  * Removed patch:\n    - fix-wrong-syspath-in-docs-conf.py.patch\n    - OSSN-0105_Accept_both_legacy_task_import_failure_modes_for_fake_URI.patch\n\n -- Thomas Goirand <email address hidden>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:41:39 +0200\n\n",
